Error [E0747]: this callback uses the effect `Io`, which the parameter doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effect_callback_bound.jet:15:28
    |
 15 |     r #= transform([1, 2], noisy);
    |                            ^^^^^
 Why: the parameter is `@Pure fn(…)`, so the callback must be pure; `Io` is outside that bound
 Fix: pass a `@Pure fn` (or a lambda that uses no effects), or widen the parameter's bound
